flowchart TD
A[Application calls read()] --> B[C library wrapper]
B --> C[System-call ABI: number and arguments]
C --> D[Trap / syscall instruction]
D --> E[CPU enters kernel mode]
E --> F[Kernel validates fd and user buffer]
F --> G[File system / page cache / device]
G --> H[Return value or error]
H --> I[CPU returns to user mode]
I --> J[Application continues]
